## @TITLE@ walkthrough patch, generated by renpy-walkthrough (`rpw.py gen`).
## Drop into the game's `game/` folder. Press W in game to toggle hints.
##
## Hints are keyed by (script file, line of the `menu:` statement). Each entry
## stores the raw caption of the menu's first item ("sig") and of every hinted
## item, and is ignored when the game's text differs, so an outdated table
## shows nothing rather than wrong advice.
##
## The game's own choice and input screens stay in charge: at init they are
## re-registered as wt_orig_choice / wt_orig_input, and the wrappers below take
## over their names, adding the hint line to each caption.
## Must stay valid under Ren'Py 7 (Python 2) and Ren'Py 8 (Python 3): no f-strings.
##
## Fail-safe: any error while taking over screens, in the self-check or at runtime switches
## the patch off (the game's own screens keep working) and prints "walkthrough: disabled".

init offset = 1

default persistent.wt_enabled = True

